      en: ["Reaches an elevation of 1,234 meters above sea level.", "Located in the southern part of the Crimean Peninsula.", "The Alupka cable car began operations in 1988.", "Recognized as the windiest place in Ukraine at 50 m/s.", "Part of the Yalta Mountain-Forest Nature Reserve.", "Famous for its distinct jagged limestone formations."],
