      en: ["Average elevation ranges from 300 to 350 meters.", "The highest peak is Mount Kamula at 471 meters.", "Features the Dniester Canyon, a significant natural landmark.", "Geology includes thick sequences of limestone and chalk.", "Dominated by highly productive chernozem (black earth) soils.", "Home to world-renowned gypsum caves like Optymistychna."],
