      en: ["Average elevations in the upland range from 150 to 200 meters.", "The Pripyat River serves as the primary drainage system for the area.", "The geological basement consists of the Ukrainian Crystalline Shield.", "Home to the Polissia Nature Reserve, founded in 1968.", "Approximately 20% of Ukraine's total forest cover is located here.", "The landscape was significantly altered during the Riss glaciation."],
